			"color":"#222",
			"widgets_values":[
				"# YuE2: Text to Music\n\nYuE2 is a music generation model that creates complete songs with vocals and instrumental accompaniment from a **music style** and **lyrics**.\n\nWith ABC Planning enabled, YuE2 first creates an editable symbolic music plan (melody and optionally chords), then generates the final audio from that plan.\n\n## Model Link\n\n**checkpoints**\n\n- [yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/YuE2/resolve/main/checkpoints/yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   └── 📂 checkpoints/\n│       └── yue2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors\n```\n\n## How to Use\n\n1. Write a description of the music you want in **Style**.\n2. Enter your song lyrics in **Lyrics** using section tags such as `[Verse]` and `[Chorus]`.\n3. Choose a planning **Mode**.\n4. Set the **Max Duration**.\n5. Run the workflow to generate the song.\n\n## Writing the Style\n\nDescribe the main musical characteristics, such as:\n\n- **Genre:** pop, jazz, rock, electronic, folk\n- **Vocals:** warm female vocal, expressive male vocal, soft vocals\n- **Language:** English, Chinese, Japanese, etc.\n- **Tempo:** 90 BPM, slow, upbeat\n- **Instruments:** piano, electric guitar, bass, drums, synths\n\nExample:\n\n> English, warm female vocal, contemporary pop, 96 BPM, piano, rounded electric bass, restrained drums, clear diction\n\nKeep musical instructions in **Style** rather than in the lyrics.\n\n## Writing Lyrics\n\nUse section tags to describe the song structure:\n\n    [Verse]\n    Morning light across the window\n    City waking down below\n\n    [Chorus]\n    Run with me into the sunlight\n    Leave the shadows far behind\n\nYou can structure the song with sections such as:\n\n`[Verse]` · `[Chorus]` · `[Bridge]` · `[Outro]`\n\nPut only the words intended to be sung in the lyrics field.\n\n## ABC Planning\n\n**Full**\nCreates a symbolic plan with **melody and chords** before generating the song. Recommended for general text-to-music generation.\n\n**Melody**\nCreates a **melody-only** plan and allows the accompaniment to be generated more freely.\n\nDisable **ABC Planning** to generate music directly from Style and Lyrics without creating a symbolic plan.\n\n## Max Duration\n\nSets the **maximum** duration of the generated song in seconds.\n\nThe song may finish earlier depending on the generated musical structure and lyrics.\n\n## Prompt Guide\n\nFor better results, describe the musical intent clearly and keep Style and Lyrics separate:\n\n**Style**\n`Language + Genre + Vocal Character + Tempo + Instruments + Musical Characteristics`\n\n**Lyrics**\nUse section tags and provide only the words that should be sung.\n\n## Learn More\n\n- [YuE2 Generation Guide](https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/blob/main/docs/generation.md)\n- [YuE2 Music Skill](https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/blob/main/skills/yue2-music/SKILL.md)\n- [Generation & Covers Reference](https://github.com/multimodal-art-projection/YuE/blob/main/skills/yue2-music/references/generation-and-covers.md)\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud updates follow stable releases, so some nightly-supported models may not be available yet.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"
			],
